<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Portfolio | MoonTea Coffee</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:wght@700&family=Roboto&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="portfolio.css">
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <h1>MoonTea Coffee</h1>
    <nav aria-label="Main navigation">
      <a href="home.html">Home</a>
      <a href="menu.html">Menu</a>
      <a href="about.html">About Us</a>
      <a href="member.html">Members</a>
      <a href="portfolio.html">Portfolio</a>
    </nav>
    <button id="theme-toggle" aria-label="Toggle theme">🌙 Toggle Theme</button>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="portfolio-hero fade-in">
      <h2>Our Portfolio</h2>
      <p>Showcasing our creative journey and community events.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="portfolio-grid fade-in">
      <div class="portfolio-card">
        <img src="event1.jpg" alt="Coffee Workshop">
        <h3>Coffee Workshop</h3>
        <p>Hands-on brewing sessions with our baristas.</p>
        <button class="view-btn">View Details</button>
        <div class="details hidden">
          <p>Jane led this workshop, teaching latte art and brewing techniques.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="portfolio-card">
        <img src="event2.jpg" alt="Tea Ceremony">
        <h3>Tea Ceremony</h3>
        <p>Celebrating the art of tea with cultural traditions.</p>
        <button class="view-btn">View Details</button>
        <div class="details hidden">
          <p>Ken curated teas and explained their origins.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="portfolio-card">
        <img src="event3.jpg" alt="Community Gathering">
        <h3>Community Gathering</h3>
        <p>Bringing people together over coffee and conversation.</p>
        <button class="view-btn">View Details</button>
        <div class="details hidden">
          <p>Amira organized pastries and coordinated the event.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="portfolio-card">
        <img src="event4.jpg" alt="Seasonal Launch">
        <h3>Seasonal Launch</h3>
        <p>Introducing new drinks and pastries every season.</p>
        <button class="view-btn">View Details</button>
        <div class="details hidden">
          <p>Team collaborated on seasonal menu design and marketing.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <p>&copy; 2026 MoonTea Coffee. All rights reserved.</p>
  </footer>

  <script src="script.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
